Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:05.86,titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Cambrian Period Audition{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is something like this just lying around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetori,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,, you're a real prehistoric nerd, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not Tetori!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I felt your passion!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.38,0:01:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of you, Kanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not that serious about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.48,0:01:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,, You're the idol of the Cambrian period!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Elrathia, the trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Trilobites are the most famous creatures of the Cambrian period!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.79,0:01:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't even told you anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.07,0:01:47.58,Cambrian Period New Idol Audition,,0,0,0,,{\c&H3EEFFF&}Cambrian Period \NNew Idol Audition
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Find Elrathia's partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.63,0:01:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,New Idol Audition!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.81,0:01:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The judges are these two!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I a judge?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,First contestant, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.38,0:02:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Anomalocaris!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.80,0:02:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What a unique look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's famous for being a fierce predator!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be an idol with Elrathia!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,together...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.87,0:02:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,, I want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.97,0:02:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's your partner! Don't eat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Moving on,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.41,0:02:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,our next contestant is this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hallucigenia!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.70,0:02:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My special skill is standing on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite unique too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you show us a handstand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.75,0:02:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.78,0:02:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.50,0:02:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She was presented to the scientific community with her top and bottom upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.66,0:02:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's funny, so it's totally okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.28,0:02:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Super positive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.28,0:02:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,, Hot dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I got hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Kanna-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.89,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Odaraia,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.50,0:03:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,an audition contestant!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.45,0:03:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You surprised me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.05,0:03:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.77,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Metaldetes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,, She's not a cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm a contestant too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that concludes the audition!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,, Thank youeveryone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is so unique!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world that used to have only plain-looking creatures,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,the Cambrian period was an era...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.11,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,where diverse life forms emerged and showed explosive evolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.16,0:03:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And even today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,, many fossils of these creatures are still being found!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.70,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Cambrian Explosion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,These unique ladies are packed with dreams and romance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.50,0:03:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They truly are idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.46,0:03:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, Kanna-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,who will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.65,0:04:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.02,0:04:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is so unique and one-of-a-kind that it's impossible to pick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they'd all make wonderful idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.50,0:04:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Elrathia-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,please announce the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of the New Idol Audition is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?! Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your uniqueness is wonderful too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.67,0:04:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be idols together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.78,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, right onto the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Elrathia-san, Kanna-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.33,0:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a huge crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad your dream of becoming an idol came true, Kanna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the kind of idol I had in mind!
